# Head of the Hunt (ruling): its replacement still exiles an opponent's creature that would die at the same time as Head itself.
# Bot1's Wrath of God destroys Head and Bot2's Ornithopter together: Head, destroyed, goes to the graveyard, the Ornithopter is
# exiled instead of dying, and Head's reflexive trigger (CR 603.12), though its source is gone, still makes Bot1 a 2/2 green Wolf.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Head of the Hunt
Wrath of God
Plains
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x19

